      "text": "⚠️TRAFFIC ADVISORY: Clarenville RCMP advises the public that heavy snowfall amounts have resulted in extremely poor road conditions along the Trans-Canada Highway throughout the region. Police and emergency crews are responding to reports of a commercial transport truck that has slid off the highway – outside Clarenville - near Thorburn Lake.\nAlthough the highway remains passable, motorist can expect delays in the area.\n\nPlease consider delaying any non-essential travel. If you must travel, please exercise caution and patience and take your time.\n\nRemember — snow means slow!\n\n#nltraffic",
